 <string name="about_zeno_title">About Zeno</string>
 <string name="about_zeno_content">Zeno is your personal AI tutor designed to make studying easier and more effective.</string>
 <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
 <string name="privacy_policy_content">1. Introduction\nWelcome to Zeno, provided by NexorAI. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information while using our application.\n\n2. Information We Collect\n- Information you provide: Name, Email, Password, Educational System, Grade, and study goals.\n- Usage and Progress Data: We track your study progress, mastered topics, weak points, and study durations.\n- Chat and Uploaded Content: We store your conversations with the AI tutor and the images/documents you upload for processing.\n- Device Data: We collect your device\'s FCM Token to send push notifications.\n- Third-Party Data: If you log in via Google, we receive your basic account identifier.\n\n3. How We Use Information\nWe use this data to provide and personalize your educational experience, generate custom study plans, answer your queries accurately, and remind you of study sessions based on your preferences.\n\n4. Data Sharing and Third Parties\nWe do not sell your data for advertising. We only share data with essential service providers to operate the app:\n- Google Services (Firebase Cloud Messaging) for push notifications.\n- AI Providers (e.g., OpenAI or Google Gemini models) to analyze your questions and generate educational content. These services process your queries solely to provide responses.\n\n5. Data Security\nAll your data and conversations are securely transmitted via encrypted connections (HTTPS) and safely stored on our servers.\n\n6. Data Retention and Deletion\nWe retain your data as long as your account is active to provide the service. You have the right to request the permanent deletion of your account and all associated data and conversations at any time through the app settings.\n\n7. Contact Us\nFor any privacy inquiries, please contact us at: support@nexorai.top</string>
 <string name="terms_content">1. Acceptance of Terms\nBy using Zeno, provided by NexorAI and governed by the laws of Egypt, you agree to comply with these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the application.\n\n2. Educational Purpose &amp; AI Limitations\n- Zeno is an educational aid powered by Artificial Intelligence to facilitate studying.\n- Despite our efforts to provide accurate answers, the AI may occasionally produce inaccurate or incomplete information. The app should not be relied upon as the sole alternative to official academic sources.\n- NexorAI is not liable for any errors in the generated content or academic decisions made based on it.\n\n3. Permitted Use\n- You agree to use the app solely for personal, educational purposes.\n- You may not use the app to send offensive or illegal content, nor attempt to hack our systems or bypass premium account restrictions.\n\n4. Account Security\nYou are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for any activities that occur under your account.\n\n5. Intellectual Property\nAll rights related to the app\'s design and source code are owned by NexorAI. Content uploaded by the user remains their property, while granting us a license to use it to provide the service.\n\n6. Termination\nWe reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time if you violate these terms, with or without prior notice.\n\n7. Changes to the Terms\nWe reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the app constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.\n\n8. Contact Information\nFor legal inquiries or support, contact us at: support@nexorai.top</string>
